  "why": [
   "QA lead, 19 Oct 2026, recorded in Rule 117 eleventh amendment item 7: for C368131, C368167 and C96936 'the expected result is not supposed to be changed and so the sources'; that case's Expected field is left exactly as it is. So this pass proposes no edit to it.",
